    {
      "id": "published",
      "topic": "Where he has been published",
      "text": "Three of my pieces have been published in Beyond the Box, and a story of mine is in BTB Quests Volume 2. My essay Planted, But Never Prosperous was published on Youth Ki Awaaz in November 2026. I am part of my school editorial team, and I was a guest speaker at Greader's Club, where I conducted a session on blogging. I also write on Medium.",
