      "id": "weather",
      "topic": "Weekly Weather Analyzer",
      "text": "The Weekly Weather Analyzer asks for a city, fetches the past seven days of hourly temperature for it from the free Open-Meteo API, works out the daily minimum, mean, median and maximum, writes both the raw hours and the summary out as CSV, and plots the four statistics as a line chart. It is one Python file using requests, pandas and Matplotlib.",
